    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Shark's Treasures Adventure, players take on the role of a fearless diver determined to collect rare treasures scattered across the ocean floor. The ocean is vast, filled with caves, and vibrant coral reefs. Your mission? Navigate these perilous waters, gather valuable treasures, and return safely to the surface. But beware: lurking in the depths are fierce sharks and other exotic sea creatures, each with unique behaviors and challenges. Only the most skilled divers will find success in the ocean\u2019s mysterious realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with the ultimate tool for survival \u2013 the Acme Volt! This special weapon lets you flip the direction of any creature in the level, sending predators and obstacles moving away from you and creating a safe path to treasures. Use it strategically to turn the tides in your favor, confuse deadly foes, and gain precious moments to escape or reach hidden rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Expansive Underwater Levels: Explore a variety of detailed underwater environments, each filled with treasures and dangers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517470/extras/06f51191a0d7dca5465172d7829deb5a.avif?t=1744296828\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exotic Sea Creatures: Encounter diverse marine life, from friendly schools of fish to fierce sharks and giant squids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517470/extras/9dde395a5e47495c0cac7ee9002f4e59.avif?t=1744296828\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ocean Shop Upgrades: Customize your gear to increase your chances of survival and make each dive more rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517470/extras/823dcc529aa97828c28304aebce69321.avif?t=1744296828\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic Resource Management: Manage oxygen and health carefully to maximize treasure collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517470/extras/52872677e2e60724450afd46da4300cf.avif?t=1744296828\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic Challenges: Each level presents new obstacles, creatures, and rewards, ensuring no two dives are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517470/extras/00cd69df07de643eced63a553d0b1bee.avif?t=1744296828\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Shark's Treasures Adventure, players take on the role of a fearless diver determined to collect rare treasures scattered across the ocean floor. The ocean is vast, filled with caves, and vibrant coral reefs. Your mission? Navigate these perilous waters, gather valuable treasures, and return safely to the surface. But beware: lurking in the depths are fierce sharks and other exotic sea creatures, each with unique behaviors and challenges. Only the most skilled divers will find success in the ocean\u2019s mysterious realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with the ultimate tool for survival \u2013 the Acme Volt! This special weapon lets you flip the direction of any creature in the level, sending predators and obstacles moving away from you and creating a safe path to treasures. Use it strategically to turn the tides in your favor, confuse deadly foes, and gain precious moments to escape or reach hidden rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Expansive Underwater Levels: Explore a variety of detailed underwater environments, each filled with treasures and dangers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517470/extras/06f51191a0d7dca5465172d7829deb5a.avif?t=1744296828\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exotic Sea Creatures: Encounter diverse marine life, from friendly schools of fish to fierce sharks and giant squids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517470/extras/9dde395a5e47495c0cac7ee9002f4e59.avif?t=1744296828\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ocean Shop Upgrades: Customize your gear to increase your chances of survival and make each dive more rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517470/extras/823dcc529aa97828c28304aebce69321.avif?t=1744296828\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic Resource Management: Manage oxygen and health carefully to maximize treasure collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517470/extras/52872677e2e60724450afd46da4300cf.avif?t=1744296828\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic Challenges: Each level presents new obstacles, creatures, and rewards, ensuring no two dives are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517470/extras/00cd69df07de643eced63a553d0b1bee.avif?t=1744296828\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p>",
